  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#42D9A3>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> SaveManager.Save(component)
    / Load(component) / FlushNow(); SaveProvider.SetLong / GetLong / Save / Load
    / OnDataSaved; FileSaveProvider.HasUnsavedChanges / FilePath.\n<color=#42D9A3>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Scene workflow:</b> 'Save Demo' holds SaveManager and SaveProviderSettingsComponent
    with Data/Save/SaveDemoProviderSettings (File provider, neo_save_demo.json).
    Buttons call SaveDemoController or SaveManager.FlushNow through persistent UnityEvents.\n<color=#42D9A3>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Verification:</b> Change values (Unsaved changes: YES), Save, stop and re-enter
    Play Mode: the values return. Save twice: two OnDataSaved events, one file write.\n<color=#42D9A3>\xBB</color> 
    'Save Demo' -> SaveProviderSettingsComponent -> SaveDemoProviderSettings (File
    provider)\n<color=#42D9A3>\xBB</color>  Btn_FlushNow (NoCode) -> SaveManager.FlushNow;
    other buttons -> SaveDemoController\n<color=#42D9A3>\xBB</color>  Save twice:
    OnDataSaved \xD72, file written \xD71 (FileSaveProvider write batching)"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
